The directory layout, plugin manifest shape, command surface (`$copilot:setup`,
`review`, `adversarial-review`, `rescue`, `status`, `result`, `cancel`), the
per-command skill structure under `skills/`, and the foreground/background job
tracking pattern follow the conventions established by cc-plugin-codex.
Implementation details have been rewritten to target GitHub Copilot CLI as the
worker (rather than Claude Code) and to support both Codex and Claude Code as
hosts from a single codebase.

